            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Tei",
            "review_text": "GaryCherryHill\nCherry Hill, New Jersey32 contributions\n0\nTerrific restaurant for sushi.\nApr 2025 • Couples\nWe were a group of 3 couples and we all ordered the special of the evening. The food was terrific- and way more than we could finish. Our waitress did not speak English and we spoke no Vietnamese- but we muddled through and had fun doing it. I recommend this place if your looking for a good sushi dinner while in HMC.\nWritten April 8, 2025",
