            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Tei",
            "review_text": "Vu\nDenmark45 contributions\n0\nGood food, terrible service\nOct 2022 • Family\nMy family and I visited this restaurant in October 22. We hadn’t eaten all day and was super hungry. The food took forever and came 1 little dish at a time with 20-30 min in between. I didn’t get my drink until at least 15 min after ordering but the rest of my family got theirs… when it finally arrived it wasn’t even what I ordered. We had to try and get the waitress’s attention, if we needed anything, which was almost impossible to make eye contact. We ended up leaving to get food another place because we were waiting way too long. But not until we got one last surprise: we had to pay for our wet wipes (!!!) no one had told us, and no other napkins was offered for us. The worst experience I’ve ever had eating at a restaurant. The absolute ONLY reason I give it 3 stars is because the food was pretty good - too bad we had to wait a lifetime to get our orders :(\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 3, 2022",
