            "review_text": "CatherineWelly\nWellington, New Zealand71 contributions\n0\nPoor service and average food. A pity for such nice location\nJun 2020\nHad lunch here with a co-worker on a rainy Sunday. We arrived at the restaurant wet, walked in the air-con restaurant and non of the staff come greet us nor offer dry tissue. \nI ordered some ordinary food: 2 sets of sashimi, some nigiris, some rolls and finish with a bowl of udon. The fish doesn't appear fresh. Then I ordered seaweed when I realised that I need some more. But by the time they brought the seaweed to our table, we had almost finished eating. \nWould happy to pay the same for a better service and food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 22, 2020",
