            "review_text": "JP F\nZoetermeer, The Netherlands140 contributions\n0\nGood food\nAug 2019 • Couples\nWe needed a break from the Vietnamese cuisine, so we opted for this place near our hotel. The place is clean and the staff is well trained. Good food too, but not the best sushi I've had outside Japan. What slightly irritated me with the sushi is that some are not well rolled, not well finished. See for yourself, the taste is ok. Slightly on the higher price, and lots of waiting time for drinks and some dishes. We constantly asked for attention, but overall ok.\n\nI think no restaurant should charge for the wet tissues when there is no other napkin provided.\nRead more\nWritten August 2, 2019",
