            "review_text": "Nick\n8 contributions\n0\nThey charge you for the wet wipes!\nSep 2018 • Couples\nWe ordered the karaage curry ( similar to katsu curry but not as fatty) makimono moriawase (mix of sushi) and miso soup. The food was very tasty with the exception of the miso soup which was below average. I probably would not have noticed had i not had miso the day before at man maru(situated opposite sushi tei) which is one of their main competitors.\n\nThe staff were friendly and i would normally have left a 4 star revuew were it not for the fact that tgere were no tissues on the table apart from a pack of wet wipes. Moreover, when i paid the bill i noticed i have been charged 6,000 dong for using these.\n\nI believe not providing napkins and charging for wet wipes is bad business practice and i do not intend to visit this particular restaurant again.\nRead more\nWritten September 5, 2018",
